1
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Kept Woman is a thriller, tv movie, mystery film directed by Michel Poulette.

2
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Jessica and her fiancé Evan just moved from the city into
their dream home on a quiet suburban street.

3
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Soon after, Jessica catches her seemingly friendly new neighbor,
Simon, in a strange lie and can't let her suspicions rest.

4
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,000
The danger escalates when Simon lures her inside his home and imprisons Jessica in his
secret bunker, meticulously decorated in the idealized style of the 1950's.

5
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Jessica, played by Courtney Ford.

6
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:06,000
Simon, played by Shaun Benson.

7
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:46,000
Evan, played by Andrew W. Walker.

8
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:26,000
Robin, played by Rachel Wilson.

9
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
Tyler, played by Troy Blundell.

10
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Oscar, played by Jesse Camacho.

11
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
Courtney Ford (born June 27, 1978) is an American actress.

12
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
She is best known for her roles on television, such as playing Christine Hill on Dexter (2009), Portia Bellefleur on True Blood (2011), Lily on Parenthood (2012), Tonia
Pyne on Murder in the First (2014), Kate Taylor on Revenge (2014), Kelly Kline on Supernatural (2016–2018) and Nora Darhk on Legends of Tomorrow (2017–2021).

13
01:13:40,000 --> 01:13:46,000
She also played the lead role in the Lifetime television film Kept Woman (2015).

14
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
The tone is mind_bending and intense.
